; ============================================================
; THE BYZANTINE SHADOW
; ROOT RUNTIME ENTRYPOINT
; ============================================================
;
; This is the file presented to the AoE2 AI loader from /ai.
; The complete runtime module graph is owned by the orchestrator
; in /ai/ShadowByzantine/ShadowByzantine.per.
;
; Keeping the root entrypoint thin prevents two independent load
; graphs from diverging and makes ShadowByzantine/ the single
; authoritative runtime package.
; ============================================================

(load "ShadowByzantine/ShadowByzantine")
